{"id":"hr7xd75u2sn3tb6n284cd2x7g","title":"pgledger-ui 开源发布：基于 PostgreSQL 的复杂数据流可视化工具","originalTitle":"Visualizing a Ledger with pgledger-ui","summary":"开发者 pgr0ss 开源了基于 PostgreSQL 的数据流可视化工具 pgledger-ui，支持点击追踪交易、统一搜索和列式视图展示。工具通过数据库查询生成网页界面，提供账户详情、时间序列图表和交易记录，支持通过元数据键关联交易，并允许分离流入和流出流量，类似标准借贷对账表视图。作者邀请用户反馈和试用，并特别提到适用于企业级财务或供应链场景的调试需求。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Lobsters 热榜"},"links":{"original":"https://www.pgrs.net/2026/11/19/visualizing-a-ledger-with-pgledger-ui/"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-19T19:55:10.812Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-19T20:33:36.303Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-19T20:33:36.303Z","category":"cool-repos","tags":["新项目","GitHub"],"score":67,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"2ee2e487-e80d-4855-a2fb-a1d165f23a44","title":"开发者pgr0ss发布基于PostgreSQL的数据流可视化工具pgledger-ui"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"2ee2e487-e80d-4855-a2fb-a1d165f23a44","title":"开发者pgr0ss发布基于PostgreSQL的数据流可视化工具pgledger-ui"}],"topics":[{"slug":"github","name":"GitHub"},{"slug":"new-project","name":"新项目首发"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fKtjzHximL34","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}